                     ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessAgg) (actual rows=1.00 loops=6)
                           Partial Mode: Partial
                           Input Batches: 1
                           Input Rows: 2
                           Kernel Calls: 1
                           ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessFilter) on parallel_t (actual rows=0.67 loops=6)
                                 Batch Filter: (parallel_t.a > 4997)
                                 Rows Removed by Batch Filter: 1666
                                 Input Batches: 82
                                 Input Rows: 5000
                                 Output Rows: 2
                                 ->  Parallel Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on parallel_t (actual rows=1666.67 loops=6)
                                       Batch Size: 64
                                       Batches: 82
                                       Pages: 28
                                       Deformed Datums: 10000
                                       Restarted Datums: 0
